OL,3,GNEWSA'Bus stop' made out of shed to
OL,4,Asupport homeless
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in a small Shropshire village
OL,7,Fhave created a fake bus stop out of an
OL,8,Fold shed to raise awareness of the need
OL,9,Fto support homeless people.
OL,11,FGraham Davis said the point of the bus
OL,12,Fstop in Rodington, which has a ledge
OL,13,Fmade to look like someone is sleeping
OL,14,Finside, was to "get across the point
OL,15,Fthat people do live in bus stops
OL,16,Funfortunately".
OL,18,FOrganisers are also encouraging people
OL,19,Fto donate items to help support people
OL,20,Fsleeping rough.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
