OL,3,GNEWSA'Bus stop' made out of shed to
OL,4,Asupport homeless
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavis said: "I understand how easy it
OL,7,Fis to get lost in life and get addicted
OL,8,Fto things, and mental health is a
OL,9,Fmassive, massive struggle, which I've
OL,10,Fstruggled with myself."
